<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex">
<title>The NexPoint User Portal — Draft</title>
<link rel="icon" href="/assets/nexpoint-logo.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/portal.css">
<style>
  /* landing hero — globe right, compact copy left */
  .hero{position:relative;padding:clamp(64px,9vh,104px) 0 clamp(48px,7vh,80px);overflow:hidden}
  .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(32px,4vw,64px);align-items:center}
  .hero h1{font:700 clamp(34px,4.2vw,56px)/1.07 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.025em;color:#0E1626;margin:0 0 20px}
  .hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--blue)}
  .hero .lede{font:400 clamp(15px,1.25vw,17.5px)/1.6 var(--font-body);color:#4A5462;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:30px}
  .hero .ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center}
  .hero .signin{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--on-surface-var);margin-top:22px}
  .hero .signin a{color:var(--blue);font-weight:600}
  .hero .signin a:hover{color:var(--blue-hover)}
  .globe-stage{position:relative;width:min(100%,520px);aspect-ratio:1/1;justify-self:end;overflow:visible}
  .globe-stage::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;width:92%;height:92%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 40% 34%,#18263e 0%,#0d1728 62%,#080f1c 88%,rgba(8,15,28,0) 100%)}
  .globe-canvas{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block;z-index:1}
  @media(max-width:1000px){
    .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .globe-stage{width:min(100%,420px);margin:8px auto 0;justify-self:center}
  }
  @media(max-width:560px){.globe-stage{width:min(90%,340px)}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<!--
THESIS: one front door to the NexPoint network; four hubs the visitor can walk into, led by photography, not copy. Refuses the everything-on-one-page portal.
OWN-WORLD: NexPoint bright clinical premium — #F5F7FA canvas, NexPoint Blue #005CC8 + Green #8BC53F accents, Montserrat/Inter, hairline rules, dark footer bookend, dotted globe with live arcs.
STORY: a lab owner recognises their industry in the imagery, picks the hub matching their need, and asks for a personal introduction.
FIRST VIEWPORT: header; left — headline, one-line promise, two hub CTAs; right — the globe on its dark disc; hub chooser begins below the fold line.
FORM: established-world extension, precisely specified brief (no concept roll; composition pinned by client answers 2026-08-12).
FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md.
-->

<div class="scroll-progress" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<header>
  <div class="container nav">
    <a href="index.html" class="wordmark" aria-label="NexPoint User Portal home"><img src="/assets/nexpoint-logo.png" alt="NexPoint"><span class="draft-pill">Portal v2 · Draft 0.2</span></a>
    <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Portal">
      <a href="print-hub.html" class="hide-m">Print Hub</a>
      <a href="mill-hub.html" class="hide-m">Mill Hub</a>
      <a href="/portal/" class="hide-m">The Board</a>
      <a href="#how" class="hide-m">How it works</a>
      <a href="#" onclick="event.preventDefault();openSignIn()">Sign in</a>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openIntro('','Talk to the desk')">Talk to the desk</button>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>
<nav class="hub-switch" aria-label="Hubs">
  <a href="print-hub.html">Print Hub</a>
  <a href="mill-hub.html">Mill Hub</a>
  <a href="/portal/">The Board</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--green">The NexPoint User Portal</span>
        <h1>One trusted network.<br>Four <em>hubs.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Print capacity, milled production, products and know-how, connected across the global O&amp;P industry. Every introduction is made person to person, by people who know both sides.</p>
        <div class="ctas">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="print-hub.html">Enter the Print Hub</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="mill-hub.html">Enter the Mill Hub</a>
        </div>
        <p class="signin">Been here before? <a href="#" onclick="event.preventDefault();openSignIn()">Sign in</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="globe-stage">
        <canvas class="globe-canvas" id="globeCanvas" role="img" aria-label="A rotating, realistically lit globe showing NexPoint's live network connections arcing between markets in the UK, Europe, North America, the Middle East, Asia, Australia and New Zealand"></canvas>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HUB CHOOSER -->
<section class="section" id="hubs">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="enter enter--up">
    <h2>Where do you want to go?</h2>
    <p class="sub">Each hub is a door into a different part of the network. Three are open today; the fourth is being built with founding members now.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="hub-grid">
      <a class="hub-card enter enter--rise" style="--d:0ms" href="print-hub.html">
        <div class="media">
          <img src="assets/img/print-hub.jpg" alt="Freshly printed nylon orthotic insoles in front of an SLS 3D printer in a bright laboratory">
          <span class="status"><span class="live-dot"></span>Live</span>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Global Print Hub</h3>
          <p>Certified 3D-printing labs across six regions print each other's work close to the end customer. The file travels — the product doesn't. One worldwide price: US$35 a pair plus shipping.</p>
          <span class="go">Enter the Print Hub <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="hub-card enter enter--rise" style="--d:80ms" href="mill-hub.html">
        <div class="media">
          <img src="assets/img/mill-hub.jpg" alt="CNC milling machine carving a custom orthotic insole from a white polypropylene block">
          <span class="status"><span class="live-dot"></span>Live</span>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Global Mill Hub</h3>
          <p>Established milled-orthotic production, run as your own line inside a partner facility: your styles, your branding, your standard, mirrored across continents for full redundancy.</p>
          <span class="go">Enter the Mill Hub <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="hub-card enter enter--rise" style="--d:160ms" href="/portal/">
        <div class="media">
          <img src="assets/img/product-hub.jpg" alt="Custom orthotic insoles and a carbon ankle-foot orthosis on a clean white surface">
          <span class="status"><span class="live-dot"></span>On the board</span>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Global Product Hub</h3>
          <p>Products, materials and technologies placed through verified, anonymised opportunities. Read the board and request an introduction; nothing is bought or sold on the page.</p>
          <span class="go">Browse the opportunity board <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg></span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <div class="hub-card soon enter enter--rise" style="--d:240ms">
        <div class="media">
          <img src="assets/img/education-hub.jpg" alt="Clinician using a handheld 3D foot scanner beside a monitor showing orthotic CAD software">
          <span class="status soon">Coming soon</span>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
          <h3>Global Education Hub</h3>
          <p>Training and digital-workflow education for teams adopting scanning, CAD/CAM and additive manufacturing for the first time. Built with the network's most experienced hands.</p>
          <span class="go" style="border-top-color:transparent"><button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="openIntro('EDUCATION HUB','Register your interest')">Register your interest</button></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- HOW -->
<section class="section alt" id="how">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="enter enter--up">
    <h2>From any hub to an introduction, quietly</h2>
    <p class="sub">The portal shows you what exists. People — not algorithms — decide what meets.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps four">
      <div class="step enter enter--up" style="--d:0ms"><span class="n">01</span><h3>Pick your hub</h3><p>Print, mill, products: each hub shows real, current capacity and opportunities, anonymised but verified by us first-hand.</p></div>
      <div class="step enter enter--up" style="--d:70ms"><span class="n">02</span><h3>Introduce yourself</h3><p>Two minutes at the desk: who you are, your volumes, your systems, what you're after. Chris or Will reads every profile personally.</p></div>
      <div class="step enter enter--up" style="--d:140ms"><span class="n">03</span><h3>A person weighs the fit</h3><p>One of us reviews every request, usually within two working days. If it isn't right, we'll tell you why and keep looking.</p></div>
      <div class="step enter enter--up" style="--d:210ms"><span class="n">04</span><h3>A personal introduction</h3><p>When both sides agree, we introduce you directly: names, faces, facilities. From there the conversation is yours; we stay close to help it land.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- PRINCIPLES -->
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="rows" style="border-top:0">
      <div class="row enter enter--up" style="--d:0ms;border-top:1px solid var(--border)">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">visibility_off</span>
        <span class="lead">Discretion as standard</span>
        <p>Every hub describes the deal, not the party. Names, prices and references never appear on the portal; they are shared only inside a personal introduction, the way good deals have always been done.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row enter enter--up" style="--d:70ms">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">verified</span>
        <span class="lead">Verified, not listed</span>
        <p>This is not a marketplace. Every node, every capacity figure and every opportunity is held by NexPoint on behalf of a partner we know personally: capacity we've seen, products we've handled, people we trust.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row enter enter--up" style="--d:140ms">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">handshake</span>
        <span class="lead">Introduced, not sold</span>
        <p>Nothing is bought here. When something fits your operation, we make a personal introduction under the network's simple terms, so both sides know where they stand, and step back. The relationship, and the deal, is yours.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="post">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="post-inner enter enter--rise">
      <h2>Printers to fill? Files to place? A production line to hand over?</h2>
      <p>Tell us once. We hold your name back, put it to the network, and bring you matched, qualified conversations, instead of you knocking on doors one at a time.</p>
      <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="openIntro('','Start at the desk')">Start at the desk, two minutes</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer__inner">
    <div class="footer__brand">
      <a href="/" aria-label="NexPoint home"><img src="/assets/nexpoint-logo.png" alt="NexPoint"></a>
      <p>The commercial bridge for Orthotics &amp; Prosthetics worldwide. Global reach across UK, EU, North America, Middle East, and Australia.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer__col">
      <h5>The Portal</h5>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="print-hub.html">Global Print Hub</a></li>
        <li><a href="mill-hub.html">Global Mill Hub</a></li>
        <li><a href="/portal/">The opportunity board</a></li>
        <li><a href="#how">How it works</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="footer__col">
      <h5>NexPoint</h5>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Main site</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#services">Services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#network">Global network</a></li>
        <li><a href="/#expertise">Why NexPoint</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="footer__col">
      <h5>Get in touch</h5>
      <div class="footer__contact">
        <a href="mailto:hello@nexpoint.co.uk" class="footer__contact-mail">hello@nexpoint.co.uk</a>
        <div class="footer__socials">
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/nexpoint-global/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="LinkedIn"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.45 20.45h-3.55v-5.57c0-1.33-.02-3.04-1.85-3.04-1.85 0-2.14 1.45-2.14 2.94v5.67H9.36V9h3.41v1.56h.05c.47-.9 1.64-1.85 3.37-1.85 3.6 0 4.27 2.37 4.27 5.46v6.28zM5.34 7.43a2.06 2.06 0 1 1 0-4.12 2.06 2.06 0 0 1 0 4.12zM7.12 20.45H3.56V9h3.56v11.45zM22.22 0H1.77C.79 0 0 .77 0 1.72v20.56C0 23.23.79 24 1.77 24h20.45c.98 0 1.78-.77 1.78-1.72V1.72C24 .77 23.2 0 22.22 0z"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footer__bar">
    <span>&copy; 2026 NexPoint Ltd. All rights reserved. Capacity figures are illustrative summaries held in confidence; identities, pricing and locations are never published.</span>
    <div class="footer__bar-links">
      <a href="/portal/privacy.html">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/">Main site</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<!-- INTRODUCTION MODAL -->
<div class="overlay" id="introOverlay" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeAll()">
  <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Ask us to introduce you">
    <button class="close" onclick="closeAll()" aria-label="Close"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">close</span></button>
    <div id="introContent"></div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- SIGN-IN MODAL -->
<div class="overlay" id="signOverlay" onclick="if(event.target===this)closeAll()">
  <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Sign in" style="max-width:440px">
    <button class="close" onclick="closeAll()" aria-label="Close"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">close</span></button>
    <div id="signContent">
      <h2>Welcome back</h2>
      <p class="body" style="margin-bottom:4px">Sign in to see the board matched to your profile.</p>
      <div class="form-grid" style="grid-template-columns:1fr;margin-top:24px">
        <div class="field"><label for="sEmail">Email</label><input id="sEmail" type="email" placeholder="you@company.com"></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="sPass">Password</label><input id="sPass" type="password" placeholder="Your password"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="signMock()">Sign in</button></div>
      <div class="privacy"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#5a8f1d" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 8.5-8 10-4.5-1.5-8-5-8-10V6l8-4z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/></svg> Draft note — accounts and sign-in arrive with the full build. This screen is illustrative.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<script src="assets/portal.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
